    "body": "Thank you for the detailed answer @nondebug. I understand why it's not possible to access such an identifier. The problem is that according to the Xsens documentation specifically calls for the MAC address of the root sensor this can be seen in the full document which you can download [here](https://content.xsens.com/e3t/Btc/ON+113/cpVSR04/MX6WfwtQqxSW8xRgv02rxsnpW8cYYgJ4FVtKdN5wYXSw3q3pBV1-WJV7CgMQRW8QFpWJ2_QN27W5MmSjm5t4LL3N7ZmlnnZ7hx2W5r4r502sHlMYW13SrWR91jBZJW537N8p3rn_2fW6Z3cND6pR98KW37fwrS6HBGc8W6Vv1td9493qfW2MPzh55gp6-wW1P-mTy7tm0VvW34MKCv5kzFdwW7y9CXb5lxBN8V-2JyJ7y0B3hW1f242Q7Mr9PNN8r4jR5q8prFV__y455PGLJwW1x2WlF3zMfKxW1TRnxn16cBWDF2w5fBqX4fJW7vbw1H8fcPGRW7dJLKS8484DlW8cm9Bw4JQnY_W8F25_07dbySCW1DdFSt5ByyFvW2dk9BN4CFkb-W2M48B85c8q2zW5vCvfm9l0z7vW9f_ygW656R4SW4zrpzC2xKXtd3gPK1) or in the screenshot below. \r\n![Screenshot_2022-04-14-20-59-38-49_e2d5b3f32b79de1d45acd1fad96fbb0f](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/57092081/163458702-8b84dbc7-4112-4cf2-8c99-5008895034c8.jpg)\r\n",
